            "required": true,
            "deprecated": false,
            "read_only": false,
            "description": "The type of the external document, being one of `statute`, `regulation`, `decision`, `contract`, or `other`.\n\n`statute` denotes primary legislation such as acts, bills, codes, and constitutions.\n\n`regulation` denotes secondary legislation such as rules, statutory instruments, and ordinances.\n\n`decision` denotes judicial or quasi-judicial decisions such as court judgments, judicial opinions, and tribunal rulings.\n\n`other` is used for all other types of legal documents that do not fit into any of the predefined types.",
